/*!
 * @mainpage food_volume_measure
 *
 * Point-cloud food volume measurement for oven trays (PCL-based).
 *
 * @section intro_sec [en] Overview
 *     Measures food volume in cubic centimeters from an empty-oven baseline and a food point
 *     cloud, using a baseline-plane height-difference integral (IM).
 * @section intro_sec [zh] 概述
 *     基于空炉基线与食物点云，用基准面高度差积分（IM）测量食材体积（立方厘米）。
 *
 * @section features_sec [en] Features
 *     - Empty-oven baseline model with RANSAC plane fitting
 *     - Open3D-equivalent voxel downsampling and DBSCAN clustering
 *     - Component-aware conservative hole completion
 *     - Reference volumes (AABB / OBB / convex hull)
 *     - PCD loading via vm::load_pcd
 * @section features_sec [zh] 特性
 *     - 基于 RANSAC 平面拟合的空炉基线模型
 *     - 与 Open3D 等价的体素降采样与 DBSCAN 聚类
 *     - 组件感知的保守补洞
 *     - 参考体积（AABB / OBB / 凸包）
 *     - 通过 vm::load_pcd 载入 PCD
 *
 * @section pipeline_sec [en] Pipeline
 *     - vm::load_pcd / vm::preprocess_cloud: load and voxel-downsample the point cloud
 *     - vm::build_baseline_model: empty-oven baseline height map
 *     - vm::extract_food_components: foreground clustering and component selection
 *     - vm::measure_component_volume: height-difference integration with hole completion
 *     - vm::VolumeMeasurement::measure: end-to-end composition
 * @section pipeline_sec [zh] 流水线
 *     - vm::load_pcd / vm::preprocess_cloud：载入并体素降采样点云
 *     - vm::build_baseline_model：空炉基线高度图
 *     - vm::extract_food_components：前景聚类与组件选择
 *     - vm::measure_component_volume：高度差积分与补洞
 *     - vm::VolumeMeasurement::measure：端到端组合
 *
 * @section usage_sec usage
 *     include headers in code:
 *     @code{.cpp}
 *     #include "volume_measurement.hpp"
 *     #include "volume_pointcloudprocess.hpp"
 *
 *     vm::PointCloud baseline = vm::load_pcd("empty_oven.pcd");
 *     vm::PointCloud food = vm::load_pcd("food.pcd");
 *     vm::VolumeMeasurement measurement;
 *     vm::VolumeEstimate est = measurement.measure({baseline}, food);
 *     @endcode
 *
 * @author Chen Zhang <chen2.zhang@szhittech.com>
 * @since 1.0
 */